==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Mooth]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 0.33~1.33 seconds<sup>10f~40f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Stall the [[Doge]]s and [[Snache]]s with [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cat]] to generate money. You can increase your chance of winning by maxing out your worker cat to level 8, or generate money at a lower level and max out that current level's wallet.

Once you have a full wallet, send out ranged cats like [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon]] or [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs]]. As you approach the base, start spamming Wall and [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cat]] to prepare for the [[Doge Dark]]s.

When [[Mooth]] appears, repeat sending out Dragon, Sexy Legs, Wall, and Macho Cat. Once you defeat the Mooth, some Doge Darks will be still alive. Defeat them and your units will start to attack the base.

